# Login Module Test Cases

## Positive

* Valid username/password
* Username case sensitivity
* Password case sensitivity
* Login using Enter key
* Login using Login button
* Successful logout
* Session timeout
* Remember previous URL after login (if applicable)
* Browser refresh after login
* Open multiple tabs

---

## Negative

* Invalid username
* Invalid password
* Invalid username and password
* Empty username
* Empty password
* Both empty
* Spaces only
* Leading spaces
* Trailing spaces
* SQL Injection attempt
* XSS attempt
* Special characters
* Very long username
* Very long password
* Unicode characters
* Emoji characters
* Copy/Paste password
* Multiple rapid login attempts

---

## UI Validation

* Logo visible
* Login button visible
* Username textbox
* Password textbox
* Forgot Password link
* Placeholder text
* Password masked
* Responsive UI
* Browser compatibility

---

## Functional

* Password masking
* Show validation messages
* Error disappears after correction
* Tab order
* Keyboard navigation
* Enter key
* Focus behavior
* Refresh page
* Back button
* Browser history

---

## Security

* HTTPS
* Password not visible
* Cookies secure
* Session ID changes
* Logout clears session
* Unauthorized URL access
* Direct dashboard URL
* Cache validation
* Browser back after logout
* Multiple sessions

---

## Forgot Password

* Valid username
* Invalid username
* Empty username
* Cancel reset
* Success message
* Validation message

---

## Dashboard

* Dashboard loads
* User name displayed
* Profile menu
* Sidebar
* Search
* Quick Launch
* Widgets
* Logout

