# Complete OrangeHRM Module Coverage

After Login, automate every available module:

1. Login
2. Dashboard
3. Admin
4. PIM
5. Leave
6. Time
7. Recruitment
8. My Info
9. Performance
10. Dashboard Widgets
11. Directory
12. Maintenance
13. Buzz

For each module, cover:

* Add
* Edit
* Delete
* Search
* Filter
* Reset
* Cancel
* Validation
* Pagination
* Sorting
* Export (if available)
* Import (if available)
* Permissions
* UI validation
* Error handling
* Boundary values
* Negative scenarios
* End-to-end workflows

## Recommended implementation order

1. Project setup
2. Configuration
3. Framework core (BasePage, BaseTest)
4. Utilities and helpers
5. Login Page Object
6. Login test suite
7. Dashboard
8. Admin module
9. PIM module
10. Remaining modules (Leave, Time, Recruitment, My Info, Performance, Directory, Maintenance, Buzz)
11. API layer
12. Reporting and logging
13. CI/CD integration
14. Docker support
15. Framework documentation (README)

This sequence mirrors how many professional QA teams build a scalable Playwright framework and will take you from an empty folder to a production-style automation project.

